### Case: order-json — a JSON body that the gateway converts to XML.
### Expect 200. The sample upstream echoes what it received, so the response shows
### the generated XML: the configured root element, the namespace, and the array
### rendered as repeated sibling elements.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/orders
content-type: application/json
accept: application/json

{"orderId":"SO-88120","lines":[{"sku":"BRK-2100","qty":4},{"sku":"FLT-0090","qty":1}]}
